{
  "version": 1,
  "summary": "登录入口是 LoginController.login，核心由 AuthService.authenticate 完成用户查询、密码校验、失败记录、会话创建和登录成功更新。",
  "coverage_note": "已检索 src/com/example/login 下的登录相关 Java 源码，并读取入口、认证服务、用户仓储、登录尝试仓储、密码校验、会话服务及管理探针；未发现更上层 HTTP 路由或依赖注入装配代码。",
  "context": {
    "question": "登录逻辑怎么实现的？调用了什么，被什么调用？读写哪些表？",
    "scope": "目录 src/com/example/login；搜索词 login、登录、/login；重点文件 LoginController.java、AuthService.java、UserRepository.java、LoginAttemptRepository.java、PasswordVerifier.java、PasswordHashLibrary.java、SessionService.java、AdminLoginProbe.java"
  },
  "findings": [
    {
      "text": "业务入口为 LoginController.login(username, password)，它直接调用 AuthService.authenticate 并返回生成的 sessionId；当前源码中未看到 HTTP 路由或控制器之外的实际框架入口。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9a7b82e4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "AuthService.authenticate 首先通过 UserRepository.findActiveByUsername 查询启用用户；如果没有用户，则记录 USER_NOT_FOUND 登录失败，并抛出 LoginRejectedException(\"账号或密码错误\")。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "user == null",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:8f3468a1",
        "sr1:9077aa80",
        "sr1:76bd38e0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "用户存在时，使用 PasswordVerifier.matches 校验明文密码与 password_hash；PasswordHashLibrary.verify 的当前实现是比较 passwordHash 是否等于 \"hash:\" + password。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:8f3468a1",
        "sr1:5d51b242",
        "sr1:10c0a7f9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "密码错误时，按用户 id 将 app_user.failed_attempts 加 1，向 login_attempt 插入失败记录，reason 为 BAD_PASSWORD，然后抛出与用户不存在相同的账号或密码错误异常。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "passwordVerifier.matches 返回 false",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:8f3468a1",
        "sr1:9077aa80",
        "sr1:76bd38e0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "密码正确时，先由 SessionService.create 生成 UUID 会话 ID，并将 sessionId 到 userId 的映射写入进程内 ConcurrentHashMap；随后更新用户成功登录状态、记录成功尝试并返回 sessionId。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "用户存在且密码校验通过",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:8f3468a1",
        "sr1:04a3a38d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "成功登录会将 app_user.last_login_at 更新为 CURRENT_TIMESTAMP，并将 failed_attempts 重置为 0；同时向 login_attempt 写入 succeeded=true、reason=SUCCESS。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "condition": "密码校验通过",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:8f3468a1",
        "sr1:9077aa80",
        "sr1:76bd38e0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "数据库访问使用 JDBC PreparedStatement；用户查询或更新、登录尝试插入失败时，会将 SQLException 包装为 IllegalStateException，具体事务边界和回滚配置在已检索源码中未体现。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9077aa80",
        "sr1:76bd38e0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "AdminLoginProbe.verify 也是 authenticate 的调用方；认证成功返回 true，捕获 LoginRejectedException 时返回 false。",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9334e43a",
        "sr1:8f3468a1"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "callers": [
    {
      "name": "LoginController.login",
      "relative_path": "src/com/example/login/LoginController.java",
      "detail": "接收 username 和 password，直接调用 authService.authenticate。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9a7b82e4",
        "sr1:84c8acd3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "AdminLoginProbe.verify",
      "relative_path": "src/com/example/login/AdminLoginProbe.java",
      "detail": "调用 authenticate；成功返回 true，捕获 LoginRejectedException 后返回 false。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9334e43a",
        "sr1:84c8acd3"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "callees": [
    {
      "name": "UserRepository.findActiveByUsername",
      "relative_path": "src/com/example/login/UserRepository.java",
      "detail": "查询启用用户的 id 和 password_hash。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:8f3468a1",
        "sr1:9077aa80"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "PasswordVerifier.matches / PasswordHashLibrary.verify",
      "relative_path": "src/com/example/login/PasswordVerifier.java",
      "detail": "校验提交密码与用户密码哈希。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:5d51b242",
        "sr1:10c0a7f9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "UserRepository.incrementFailedAttempts",
      "relative_path": "src/com/example/login/UserRepository.java",
      "detail": "密码错误时更新失败次数。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:8f3468a1",
        "sr1:9077aa80"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoginAttemptRepository.record",
      "relative_path": "src/com/example/login/LoginAttemptRepository.java",
      "detail": "记录 USER_NOT_FOUND、BAD_PASSWORD 或 SUCCESS 登录尝试。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:8f3468a1",
        "sr1:76bd38e0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "SessionService.create",
      "relative_path": "src/com/example/login/SessionService.java",
      "detail": "生成 UUID 并将会话映射写入进程内 ConcurrentHashMap。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:8f3468a1",
        "sr1:04a3a38d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "LoginRejectedException",
      "relative_path": "src/com/example/login/LoginRejectedException.java",
      "detail": "用户不存在或密码错误时抛出，用于表示认证拒绝。",
      "kind": "direct",
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:8f3468a1"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "data_accesses": [
    {
      "object": "app_user",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "read"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "每次 authenticate 开始时按 username 查询",
        "仅返回 enabled = TRUE 的用户"
      ],
      "access_method": "SELECT id, password_hash FROM app_user WHERE username = ? AND enabled = TRUE",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9077aa80"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "app_user",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "update"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "用户存在但密码校验失败时，按 userId 更新"
      ],
      "access_method": "UPDATE app_user SET failed_attempts = failed_attempts + 1 WHERE id = ?",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9077aa80",
        "sr1:8f3468a1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "app_user",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "update"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "密码校验成功时，按 userId 更新"
      ],
      "access_method": "UPDATE app_user SET last_login_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, failed_attempts = 0 WHERE id = ?",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:9077aa80",
        "sr1:8f3468a1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "login_attempt",
      "category": "db_object",
      "operations": [
        "insert"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "用户不存在时插入 succeeded=false、reason=USER_NOT_FOUND",
        "密码错误时插入 succeeded=false、reason=BAD_PASSWORD",
        "登录成功时插入 succeeded=true、reason=SUCCESS"
      ],
      "access_method": "INSERT INTO login_attempt(username, succeeded, reason) VALUES (?, ?, ?)",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:76bd38e0",
        "sr1:8f3468a1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "object": "SessionService.sessions: ConcurrentHashMap<String, Long>",
      "category": "cache",
      "operations": [
        "insert"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        "密码校验成功后创建会话"
      ],
      "access_method": "sessions.put(sessionId, userId)",
      "state": {
        "type": "observed"
      },
      "source_ids": [
        "sr1:04a3a38d"
      ]
    }
  ],
